{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028000601818-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028131307\"/><p>南亞裔電單車外賣員倒臥於路中。</p><p>元朗發生交通意外。昨日(27日)晚上10時38分，一名南亞裔電單車外賣員，駛至馬田路與教育路交界時，與一輛私家車發生碰撞，南亞裔鐵騎士人仰車翻，私家車司機報案求助。救護員接報到場，鐵騎士幸僅手腳擦傷，經初步治理後，拒絕送院。警員正調查意外起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:57.692504+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:06:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.954845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:28.149352+00:00","content_hash":"1d57ee4afa004169f039d8c5a8cb3e5d08b7c92691f37765014d66cc127f2957","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:57.692504+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}